                  <i className="fas fa-triangle-exclamation" style={{marginTop:1,flexShrink:0}}></i>
                  <span><b>{subDisplayName(ref)} is already active</b>, so the ₱{Number(cs.referral_reward_amount||0).toLocaleString()} referral credit will be applied on save regardless of this checkbox — an already-active referee has no future activation to defer to, so the referrer is always credited now.</span>
